00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:19.640
These levels are not the same as, as the other ones in the sense that like the other ones made

00:24:19.640 --> 00:24:23.500
it very clear, like, okay, you're now entering this building and you just kind of have to find

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:24.340
your way through it.

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:26.300
And then, you know, keep progressing to the right.

