00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:34.220
And it's not like it leaves.

00:24:34.380 --> 00:24:36.000
It's almost like a maze in a way.

00:24:36.240 --> 00:24:38.920
It doesn't switch to like a first person view or anything.

00:24:38.920 --> 00:24:39.940
That would have been disastrous.

00:24:40.480 --> 00:24:41.760
But it is still.

00:24:41.920 --> 00:24:43.520
I'm surprised that again. Right.

